## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to combine nonlinear PCA with streaming data, GPU acceleration, and production latency constraints in a high-throughput setting.

## Key Concepts
- Kernel PCA via random Fourier features
- Incremental SVD in RKHS
- Streaming imputation and normalization
- Drift detection and adaptive component retention
